    "title": "Maple Leafs visit Mayich family in Arizona, wear special T-shirts, hats - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anna Kulesa ,\n9 hours ago The Toronto Maple Leafs showed their support for Matthew Mayich and his family during their trip to Arizona on Saturday. The team wore custom T-shirts which featured a drawing of the Arizona State defenseman’s face and his No. 27 during their practice at the college’s Mullett Arena. They also wore hats featuring Mayich’s initials, number and a yellow ribbon. Read full article",
